{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>一間旅遊公司懷疑被冒認航空公司職員的騙徒，騙取約320萬元。據了解，涉及的是「龍騰出行」。</p><p></p><p>據了解，提供旅行食宿及機票的「龍騰出行」，一名職員5月收到自稱是航空公司職員的電郵，指公司銀行資料要更新及預支費用。職員按指示分三次、將約320萬元轉帳至另外三名騙徒的銀行戶口。他上月聯絡航空公司核實，才發現受騙。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T06:35:01.688859+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":153,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T04:53:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T06:38:30.701320+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T06:28:21.465788+00:00","content_hash":"b20d771dcf58ee85b742b4d9eed1dfe42991211937c5f8b0b66838b461a9b603","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-24T06:35:01.688859+00:00","latest_fallback":"minimal","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}